  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童拼插帐篷搭建套装",
    "en": "Kids Interlocking Tent Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向儿童拼插搭建场景的帐篷套装，适用于家庭亲子互动、课堂活动和主题游戏空间布置。产品支持搭建与拆装，适合连续的创意构建玩法。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地广东东莞茶山，内帐材料为PP，帐篷结构为双层帐。",
    "en": "This is a tent-style interlocking building set for children, suitable for family interaction, classroom activities, and themed play-area setup. It supports assembly and disassembly for repeatable creative construction play.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan, Guangdong. Inner-tent material is PP, and the tent structure is double-layer."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童拼插帐篷搭建套装以可拼接结构为核心，适合围绕帐篷、通道与互动空间进行多形态搭建。产品支持搭建后重复拆装，便于在不同活动场景中灵活使用。",
      "产品可用于家庭亲子游戏、幼教活动和课程化互动道具场景，通过拼搭过程帮助提升空间认知、协作能力与动手实践体验。",
      "包装提供体积与重量等关键参数，便于渠道做仓配和上架管理。适合长期供货与项目化采购协同。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids interlocking tent building set is designed around a modular construction structure and supports multiple layout forms for tents, tunnels, and interactive play spaces. The set supports repeated assembly and disassembly for flexible scenario use.",
      "It is suitable for family parent-child play, preschool activities, and structured educational props. The building process helps improve spatial awareness, collaboration, and hands-on practice.",
      "Packaging includes key volume and weight data for channel warehousing and listing management, and is suitable for long-term supply and project-based procurement."
    ]
  },
